{"version":1,"content":"<p>在月球上生活的太空人未來或許能呼吸到從月壤中提取的氧氣，而這項技術的靈感來自計算機晶片製造。都柏林城市大學和歐洲空間局的研究人員發現，利用半導體工業廣泛使用的等離子體處理技術，可以從模擬月壤的材料中提取氧氣以及含氧產物，相關成果已發表在《科學報告》上。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588262.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:24:21.370380+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:16:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:33.901695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:33.901695+00:00","content_hash":"a21c362627c435505865c17b93fd0110dc6b8d8a2f9d2904dba44816e0613e7f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}